 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Top Ranker's Aspiring Writer Life Manual"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "탑랭커의 작가지망생활백서"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A legendary hunter gives up his title to become a web novelist, only to realize his stories lack realism. To fix this, he disguises himself as a weak F-rank hunter and joins a struggling guild for research. What starts as simple observation turns into genuine admiration, pushing him to grow both as a person and a writer. Can a former god-like warrior succeed as an ordinary novelist?"
  },
